   "status": "disagree",
   "regex_value": null,
   "llm_value": "Personal electronics are not reimbursable.",
   "agreed_value": null,
   "evidence": "This includes, and is not limited to:\nheadphones and earbuds, smart watches and fitness trackers, tablets and e-readers, games\nconsoles, cameras and drones, televisions, portable speakers, and item trackers. Accessories made\nfor such a device \u2014 cases, chargers, screen protectors \u2014 count as personal electronics too.\nPurchase of any of these on an expense report is a **high** exception, regardless of stated\nbusiness purpose.",
